Rebalance_childToRemoteChild_CcipFork
├── given the active strategy is Base Aave V3
├── and TVL exists in the Base child strategy
├── when CRE initiates rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── and CRE executes rebalance through Base Child WorkflowRouter
├── then ChildVault should withdraw all TVL from Base Aave V3
├── and ChildVault should send the TVL to Ethereum through local CCIP
├── and Ethereum ChildVault should deposit the TVL into Ethereum Aave V3
├── and Base ChildVault should clear its active adapter
├── when CRE completes rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should finalize the rebalance
├── and ParentVault should increment the rebalance nonce
└── and the active strategy should be Ethereum Aave V3
